{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JAgAVmbWuNtrGqJ8a57T6U","type":"tool_result","content":"rtl\nspec.md\ntb\n---\n# priority_encoder\n\nAn 8-input combinational priority encoder. The highest-numbered asserted input wins.\n\n## Ports\n| Port  | Dir | Width | Description |\n|-------|-----|-------|-------------|\n| in    | in  | 8     | Request inputs; bit 7 has the highest priority |\n| y     | out | 3     | Index of the highest-numbered bit of `in` that is 1 |\n| valid | out | 1     | High when any bit of `in` is 1 |\n\n## Behavior\n- Purely combinational; no clock or reset.\n- If `in` is non-zero: `valid = 1` and `y` = the index of the most significant 1 bit of `in`\n  (e.g. `in = 8'b0010_1100` gives `y = 5`; `in = 8'b0000_1000` gives `y = 3`).\n- If `in` is zero: `valid = 0` and `y = 0`.\n- Outputs are never X or Z for any fully-specified input.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7347b303-a599-428f-8fb6-1fdf4fed7a85","uuid":"ff80418c-b06c-4569-87c1-82f85da3c7a2","timestamp":"2026-10-19T23:41:36.152Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"rtl\nspec.md\ntb\n---\n# priority_encoder\n\nAn 8-input combinational priority encoder. The highest-numbered asserted input wins.\n\n## Ports\n| Port  | Dir | Width | Description |\n|-------|-----|-------|-------------|\n| in    | in  | 8     | Request inputs; bit 7 has the highest priority |\n| y     | out | 3     | Index of the highest-numbered bit of `in` that is 1 |\n| valid | out | 1     | High when any bit of `in` is 1 |\n\n## Behavior\n- Purely combinational; no clock or reset.\n- If `in` is non-zero: `valid = 1` and `y` = the index of the most significant 1 bit of `in`\n  (e.g. `in = 8'b0010_1100` gives `y = 5`; `in = 8'b0000_1000` gives `y = 3`).\n- If `in` is zero: `valid = 0` and `y = 0`.\n- Outputs are never X or Z for any fully-specified input.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
